OL,3,AUS citizen Stephen Hubbard freed by
OL,4,ARussia and 'on his way home', Trump
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia has agreed to release a
OL,8,F74-year-old American citizen who was
OL,9,Fjailed for allegedly fighting on behalf
OL,10,Fof Ukraine.
OL,12,FStephen Hubbard has been taken to
OL,13,FPulkovo Airport, Putin said during
OL,14,Ftalks with US envoy Steve Witkoff in St
OL,15,FPetersburg, according to state media.
OL,17,FPresident Trump said Hubbard was "on
OL,18,Fhis way back home" and "there was no
OL,19,F'swap' necessary for this release".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
